## 🏗️ System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD

    A[👨‍🏫 Teacher] -->|Create Assignment| B[Express API]

    B -->|Save Assignment| C[(MongoDB)]

    B -->|Add Notification Job| D[BullMQ Queue]

    D --> E[(Redis)]

    E -->|Job picked up| F[Notification Worker]

    F -->|Find assigned students| C

    F -->|Create notifications| G[(MongoDB Notifications)]

    F -->|Publish notification event| H[Redis Pub/Sub]

    H -->|Subscribe| I[Redis Subscriber]

    I -->|Emit new-assignment| J[Socket.IO]

    J --> K[👨‍🎓 Student 1]
    J --> L[👨‍🎓 Student 2]
    J --> M[👨‍🎓 Student 3]
```
